story.summaryEn:
An evening of celebration with @PepperstoneFX.
@PedrodelaRosa1 joined Pepperstone last night to mark our enhanced partnership, bringing guests closer to the team through an exclusive Q&A and a showcase of Fernando’s helmet and Lance’s race suit.
#MexicoGP

detailZh:
与@PepperstoneFX共度庆祝之夜。
@PedrodelaRosa1昨晚加入Pepperstone，以庆祝我们加强的合作伙伴关系，通过独家问答和展示费尔南多的头盔以及兰斯的赛车服，让嘉宾更接近车队。
#墨西哥大奖赛

